### GET all products (no filter)
GET {{BE_URL}}/products

### GET products with filters (camelCase format - auto converted to snake_case)
GET {{BE_URL}}/products?status=active&productCode=P001&categoryId=1&page=1&limit=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC

### GET products with price range
GET {{BE_URL}}/products?minPrice=100000&maxPrice=500000

### GET products by product type and color
GET {{BE_URL}}/products?productTypeId=2&colorVn=Đỏ

### GET products by name (Vietnamese)
GET {{BE_URL}}/products?productNameVn=Sofa

### PUT - Update product (all fields with new images)
PUT {{BE_URL}}/products/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productCode"

P001-UPDATED
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productNameVn"

Ghế Sofa Cao Cấp Mới
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="length"

200
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="width"

100
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="height"

80
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="materialVn"

Gỗ sồi cao cấp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="colorVn"

Nâu đậm
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Mô tả mới cho sản phẩm
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

15000000
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productTypeId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="originVn"

Việt Nam
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="warrantyPeriod"

24
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mainImage"; filename="main-new.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/new-main-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subImage"; filename="sub1-new.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/new-sub-image-1.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subImage"; filename="sub2-new.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/new-sub-image-2.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

